{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣歌手「哈林」庾澄慶近期推出新歌《枝仔冰》，並在日前舉行演唱會時，邀請金曲歌后A-Lin擔任嘉賓，兩人在舞台上的互動帶來不少笑聲。</p><p>演出結束後，庾澄慶特地透過社交平台發文感謝工作團隊、歌迷及嘉賓，沒想到卻因為標籤帳號時做漏一個步驟，意外引來</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T18:20:22.027707+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T18:01:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T18:18:11.892937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T18:18:11.892937+00:00","content_hash":"5d9575fa2e6a1269dabe02ffe7fbec323778083318e4d38dc422fd23dc862a51","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}